    "reason": "The proposed exposure only checks spec.rules[].context[].apiCall on ClusterPolicy and Policy, so it is too narrow. The rendered diffs show that apiCall.default was added to more places: context entries under rules[].mutate.foreach[], rules[].mutate.targets[] and rules[].validate.foreach[] [ev-13c3ac894c61, ev-e0d064dacf28, ev-e25376a41cf1, ev-d0b8f312ef56, ev-f4d7f536bf4a, ev-1096286e1c4f], and spec.context[].apiCall on CleanupPolicy and ClusterCleanupPolicy [ev-9348cb2d7f00, ev-a77e0fc2c18d]. The field is an optional fallback used only when the API call returns an error [ev-bed2899bb4db, ev-e0408f021210]. So the relevant environments are those that define an apiCall context entry in any of these places, and the corrected condition covers all of them.",
